/.happier/uploads/

# Full-resolution feature-art sources. Responsive web variants are generated
# into public/images/_opt (ignored) via `yarn optimize:images` and recreated by
# the production build. Includes _superseded/, which keeps prior raws locally.
/assets/features/**/*.png

# Build output. `dist-ssr` is the build-time renderer consumed by
# scripts/prerender.mjs; it is deleted on a successful prerender, so a copy on
# disk means a build was interrupted.
/dist
/dist-ssr

# Generated image variants (scripts/optimize-images.mjs). Regenerated by
# `yarn build`; the typed manifest src/data/generatedImages.ts IS committed so a
# typecheck without a prior image build still passes.
/public/images/_opt/
